\label{prop.localR2}
   Let $\varepsilon < r$ and $A^\varepsilon$ satisfy \eqref{ellipticity} and \eqref{eq.periodicInxd}. Let $u_\varepsilon$ be a solution of
       \begin{equation}\label{eq.Rp.T3r}
   \left\{
