\label{rmk.Bp-Dp'}
    The proof of Theorem \ref{thm.Neve<f} gives the following result. If $\overline{\omega}_\varepsilon^X \in B_p(d\sigma)$ for some $p>1$, namely, for $X\in \Omega\setminus B_{10r}(P)$,
