     & \lesssim \bigg( \fint_{I_{3R}} |\widetilde{N}_\varepsilon(\nabla u_\varepsilon)|^{2} d\sigma \bigg)^{1/{2}} + \bigg( \fint_{I_{4R}\cap \Omega_{10\varepsilon}} |\nabla u_\varepsilon|^{2} d\sigma \bigg)^{1/{2}} + \bigg( \fint_{I_{4R}} |\nabla_{\tan} f|^{p} d\sigma \bigg)^{1/p}. 
