According to the three terms on the right-hand side of \eqref{def.Fe}, we write $F_\varepsilon = F_\varepsilon^{1} + F_\varepsilon^2 + F_\varepsilon^3$.
We begin with the estimate of $F_\varepsilon^1$.
By the triangle inequality, we have
